  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0: several official accounts on one site, event handlers, postback staging and a single-image imagemap. New: named channels (AddLineMessaging(name, ...) and AddLineLiff(name, ...), ILineMessagingClientFactory and ILineLiffClientFactory with Get, Contains and ChannelNames, ILineMessagingClient.ChannelName as a default interface member, per-channel HttpClient names; the empty string stays the default channel and an unnamed registration behaves as before); LineWebhookHandler, an abstract base with 21 On*Async methods, and LineWebhookContext with once-only ReplyAsync and ReplyTextAsync; ILinePostbackDataStore (in memory or a JSON file, with a lifetime), AddLinePostbackData, PostbackAction.CreateStoredAsync and LinePostbackDataResolver to stage long postback data behind an ozl: token; ImagemapMessage.ForSingleImage (experimental); auto reply rules gain an optional ChannelName (empty means every channel, so stored rules keep working) and ILineAutoReplyService.HandleAsync gains a channel overload. New error codes: line.webhook.no_reply_token, line.webhook.reply_token_used, line.webhook.not_postback, line.postback.expired and line.validation.postback_data_too_long; existing codes and categories are unchanged. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
